<< /A 78 0 R /Alt (Sixteen-panel collage of underwater footage showing a robotic vehicle identifying marine life on the ocean floor with blue and white labeled boxes indicating detected species such as sea urchin, holothurian, scallop, and starfish, each marked with confidence scores.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 59 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
